{"4453420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DDD: Dice, Dungeons, and Drakes", "steam_appid": 4453420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📢 LONG-TAIL BREAKOUT UPDATE: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are incredibly honored to announce that following our quiet initial deployment, 《DDD》 has triggered an explosive, word-of-mouth viral wave! Within 24 hours of breaking out, our tactical combat demo organically captured the No. 1 Daily Trending Spot on Kadokawa's Dengeki Online in Japan—surpassing major commercial blockbusters and generating over 2.20 Million verified organic impressions! A massive thank you to our amazing early players for recognizing our raw wargaming code and systemic depth!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FORGE YOUR PATH. ROLL YOUR FATE.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE &quot;DICE-TO-TILE&quot; MECHANICS</strong><br>Every turn is a gamble: Will you roll for <strong>Summoning</strong> or <strong>Action</strong>?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge the Path:</strong> Watch your Summon Dice disassemble into 6 unique road-tiles, physically building the battlefield in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Conquest:</strong> Expand your territory (Blue vs. Red) to reach the enemy Lordmaster and strike for the win.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEEP TACTICAL STRATEGY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scaling Action Costs:</strong> Manage your Crest Pool wisely. Every step and attack costs more than the last (1-2-3 scaling). High-level monsters carry a &quot;Heavy&quot; tax—choose your moves carefully!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Counter or Bypassed:</strong> Defend with <strong>Dodge, Parry, or Block</strong>. But beware—<strong>Ability Attacks</strong> ignore all defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Crest Pool:</strong> Master the overflow. Extra crests convert into <strong>Move</strong>, ensuring your army never stops marching.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY: REDEMPTION OF THE DICE HUNTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the village of Chenxi, Koki Rain was a guardian to thirty orphans. Three years ago, he was swallowed by the Abyssal Maw. Now, a blood-red sigil suggests he is alive on Hunter's Island.<br>You are <strong>Eden</strong>. Armed with Koki’s legacy, you must board the <i>Sea Swallow</i> and enter the world’s most dangerous competition to find the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📢 逆袭爆发公告：</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >我们非常荣幸地宣布，在历经前期的低调潜心迭代后，《DDD》凭借玩家间的硬核口碑彻底引爆了长尾增长奇迹！在爆发短短 24 小时内，我们的免费战斗试玩版便有机斩获了日本角川（Kadokawa）旗下最高权威媒体《电击Online》每日综合热门文章排行榜第 1 名 —— 热度不仅超越了多款本土商业巨头，更狂揽了超过 220 万次官方验证的海外媒体有机曝光！由衷感谢首批陪伴我们、慧眼识珠的核心玩家，是你们见证了独立研发的代码奇迹！</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>锻造路径，掷出命运</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>独创的“骰子转地块”机制</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每一回合都是一场豪赌：你会选择掷出<strong>召唤骰子</strong>还是<strong>行动骰子</strong>？</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>开辟道路：</strong> 亲眼见证你的召唤骰子拆解为 6 条独特的道路地块，实时构建战场。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>战术征服：</strong> 扩张你的领地（蓝队 vs 红队），直至抵达敌方领主身边并给予致命一击。</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>深度战术策略</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>阶梯式行动消耗：</strong> 明智地管理你的纹章池。每一步行动和攻击的成本都会随之递增（1-2-3 阶梯式消耗）。高等级怪兽行动沉重——请谨慎选择你的每一步！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>防御与无视：</strong> 使用<strong>闪避、招架或格挡</strong>进行防御。但要小心——<strong>技能攻击</strong>会无视所有防御手段。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>纹章池：</strong> 掌控溢出机制。多余的纹章会转化为<strong>移动点数</strong>，确保你的军团永不停歇。</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>剧情：骰子猎人的赎罪之路</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在晨曦村，高希·雷恩 (Koki Rain) 曾是三十名孤儿的守护者。三年前，他被深渊巨口吞噬。如今，一枚血红色的印记预示着他还活在猎人岛 (Hunter's Island) 上。<br>你将扮演 <strong>伊甸 (Eden)</strong>。带着柯基留下的遗产，你必须登上“海燕号”，参加这场世界上最危险的竞赛，寻找被埋没的真相。</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📢 LONG-TAIL BREAKOUT UPDATE: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are incredibly honored to announce that following our quiet initial deployment, 《DDD》 has triggered an explosive, word-of-mouth viral wave! Within 24 hours of breaking out, our tactical combat demo organically captured the No. 1 Daily Trending Spot on Kadokawa's Dengeki Online in Japan—surpassing major commercial blockbusters and generating over 2.20 Million verified organic impressions! A massive thank you to our amazing early players for recognizing our raw wargaming code and systemic depth!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FORGE YOUR PATH. ROLL YOUR FATE.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE &quot;DICE-TO-TILE&quot; MECHANICS</strong><br>Every turn is a gamble: Will you roll for <strong>Summoning</strong> or <strong>Action</strong>?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge the Path:</strong> Watch your Summon Dice disassemble into 6 unique road-tiles, physically building the battlefield in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Conquest:</strong> Expand your territory (Blue vs. Red) to reach the enemy Lordmaster and strike for the win.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEEP TACTICAL STRATEGY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scaling Action Costs:</strong> Manage your Crest Pool wisely. Every step and attack costs more than the last (1-2-3 scaling). High-level monsters carry a &quot;Heavy&quot; tax—choose your moves carefully!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Counter or Bypassed:</strong> Defend with <strong>Dodge, Parry, or Block</strong>. But beware—<strong>Ability Attacks</strong> ignore all defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Crest Pool:</strong> Master the overflow. Extra crests convert into <strong>Move</strong>, ensuring your army never stops marching.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY: REDEMPTION OF THE DICE HUNTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the village of Chenxi, Koki Rain was a guardian to thirty orphans. Three years ago, he was swallowed by the Abyssal Maw. Now, a blood-red sigil suggests he is alive on Hunter's Island.<br>You are <strong>Eden</strong>. Armed with Koki’s legacy, you must board the <i>Sea Swallow</i> and enter the world’s most dangerous competition to find the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📢 逆袭爆发公告：</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >我们非常荣幸地宣布，在历经前期的低调潜心迭代后，《DDD》凭借玩家间的硬核口碑彻底引爆了长尾增长奇迹！在爆发短短 24 小时内，我们的免费战斗试玩版便有机斩获了日本角川（Kadokawa）旗下最高权威媒体《电击Online》每日综合热门文章排行榜第 1 名 —— 热度不仅超越了多款本土商业巨头，更狂揽了超过 220 万次官方验证的海外媒体有机曝光！由衷感谢首批陪伴我们、慧眼识珠的核心玩家，是你们见证了独立研发的代码奇迹！</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>锻造路径，掷出命运</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>独创的“骰子转地块”机制</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每一回合都是一场豪赌：你会选择掷出<strong>召唤骰子</strong>还是<strong>行动骰子</strong>？</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>开辟道路：</strong> 亲眼见证你的召唤骰子拆解为 6 条独特的道路地块，实时构建战场。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>战术征服：</strong> 扩张你的领地（蓝队 vs 红队），直至抵达敌方领主身边并给予致命一击。</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>深度战术策略</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>阶梯式行动消耗：</strong> 明智地管理你的纹章池。每一步行动和攻击的成本都会随之递增（1-2-3 阶梯式消耗）。高等级怪兽行动沉重——请谨慎选择你的每一步！</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>防御与无视：</strong> 使用<strong>闪避、招架或格挡</strong>进行防御。但要小心——<strong>技能攻击</strong>会无视所有防御手段。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>纹章池：</strong> 掌控溢出机制。多余的纹章会转化为<strong>移动点数</strong>，确保你的军团永不停歇。</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>剧情：骰子猎人的赎罪之路</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在晨曦村，高希·雷恩 (Koki Rain) 曾是三十名孤儿的守护者。三年前，他被深渊巨口吞噬。如今，一枚血红色的印记预示着他还活在猎人岛 (Hunter's Island) 上。<br>你将扮演 <strong>伊甸 (Eden)</strong>。带着柯基留下的遗产，你必须登上“海燕号”，参加这场世界上最危险的竞赛，寻找被埋没的真相。</p>", "short_description": "Master a unique tactical board-game battler! Roll to summon monsters and watch your dice disassemble into road-tiles to forge a path to the enemy Lord. Balance Summon and Action dice, manage crest inventories, and cast powerful spells to crush the rival Lord in DDD: Dice, Dungeons &amp; Drakes.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4453420/35c90a92d745f695f3feac782a2ed51d5d68861e/header.jpg?t=1784814718", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4453420/f83480f713dcd5e2e7c475b64ac896ae3f7c7083/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784814718", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4453420/f83480f713dcd5e2e7c475b64ac896ae3f7c7083/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784814718", "website": "https://mightyedenstudio.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-10400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Audio Device</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-12400F <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB availa